el speaking. How may I help you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello. I want to inquire  about the position in your restaurant.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: Which one do you wish to apply for?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Is there more than one?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: Yes. The kitchen needs a sous-chef and a line cook. <br/>", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn4le18ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What does the sous-chef job entail?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: Well, it can be rewarding, but you need to be able to work long hours. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's the salary like?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>:  It depends on your experience. We can negotiate that during the interview.<br/>", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn4le18ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Do I need anything in particular to apply?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: You have to bring your resume and some reference letters. Are you free tomorrow at 10 a.m.?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely! Do I need to come to the restaurant?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant manager</span>: Yes. See you tomorrow morning.", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn4le18ob02re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa's Part-Time Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Application Process"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Achievement Test > Achievement Test"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use information about personal and professional plans for the future in social and work situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le18ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Requesting Information"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What's the salary like?<br/>        <span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: Well, we can negotiate that during the interview."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you need to ask a stranger for work information, you use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Excuse me\u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Sorry\u2026</span> to get their attention.<br/> <br/> When you provide information to a stranger about your place of work, you can reply with an offer of help like <span class=\"italic\">How can I help you?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Requesting Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Providing information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Excuse me\u2026<br/> I have an inquiry about the position.<br/> What does the job entail?<br/> What's the salary like?<br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, how can I help you?<br/> Which one?<br/>  Well\u2026<br/> We can...<br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inquiry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a question"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have an inquiry about the job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a conversation about a job at a restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "position"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Which position do you want to apply for?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to entail"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to involve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What does the job entail?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sous-chef"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a restaurant, the second person in charge of the kitchen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sous-chef position offers a lot of rewards."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "line cook"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " in a restaurant, a person who prepares ingredients and dishes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A line cook helps the sous-chef with the dishes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "long hours"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "working outside the regular business hours"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to be able to work long hours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "salary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pay"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's the salary like for the sous-chef job?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to negotiate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to reach an agreement about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can negotiate your salary during the interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue with a partner preparing for a job interview (8-10 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about a job you would like to apply for."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for information about the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give details and information about the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about jobs with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I request information about a job I would like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give instructions about the job."}]}], "type": "sena"}